# Working files, rewritten every run. The durable state is queue.jsonl (what to
# post, and what was posted) and seen.json (what has already been considered).
#
# inbox.json is one day of arXiv; drafts.json is what the agent proposed before
# the gate looked at it. Committing either would put a rejected draft in the
# history as though it had been approved.
inbox.json
drafts.json
